1
00:00:00,593 --> 00:00:01,423
晚安 宝贝
Good night, sweatpea.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,480
晚安 亲爱的
Good night, honey.

3
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:06,940
米奇尔
Mitchell!

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,540
咱们的热水浴缸里有个陌生人
There's a stranger in our hot tub!

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:09,380
是谁
Who is it?!

6
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,800
你知道陌生人是什么意思吧
You do know what "stranger" means, don't you?

7
00:00:12,274 --> 00:00:13,574
天啊 我的天啊
Oh, my g -- oh, my god!

8
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:14,760
他在那儿多久了
How long has he been there?

9
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:17,220
我在你看到他的前一秒才看到他
I saw him exactly one second before you.

10
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,500
咱俩知道的一样多
You know everything I know.

11
00:00:18,684 --> 00:00:19,984
好吧 我去报警
Okay, I'm -- I'm calling 911.

12
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:20,880
我去拿我的球棒
I'm getting my bat.

13
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,680
或许我们反应过度了
Maybe we're overreacting.

14
00:00:25,885 --> 00:00:26,855
是啊 他或许有个很好的理由
Yeah, he could have a very good reason for be --

15
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:27,940
我们至少应该去打个招呼
We should at least say hello.

16
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:28,800
只是出于礼貌
It's only polite.

17
00:00:29,025 --> 00:00:30,525
好的
Okay.

18
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,660
于是我死死地盯住那只土狼
So I looked that coyote dead in the eye,

19
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:47,460
我一句话都没说 就让它明白了
and I let him know, without saying a word,

20
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:49,420
我不会伤害你的
"I will not harm you...

21
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,960
但是我才是这里的老大
but I'm the alpha here".

22
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:54,160
而它也紧紧地盯着我
And he just stared back at me...

23
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:55,260
完全被我迷惑住了
mesmerized.

24
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:00,240
太神奇了
Amazing.

25
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:03,940
原来 贝瑞刚搬进我们楼上的公寓
Turns out, Barry just moved into the apartment upstairs

26
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:05,880
他以为这个热水浴盆是全楼公用的
and thought the hot tub was for the whole building.

27
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:09,000
总而言之 他酷呆了 而且他是直男
Anyway, he's a super-cool guy, and he's straight,

28
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,380
所以没什么好尴尬的
so there's no weirdness.

29
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:13,060
除了你变成了个十六岁的小姑娘
Aside from you turning into a 16-year-old girl.

30
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:13,940
我才没呢
I did not.

31
00:01:16,420 --> 00:01:17,480
卡梅隆 把你的手臂给我
Cameron, give me your arm.

32
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:18,220
好
Okay.

33
00:01:22,478 --> 00:01:23,978
你在做什么
What cha doin'?

34
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:25,880
我正在学做一名灵气按摩师
Oh, I'm studying to be a reiki master.

35
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:28,720
我正在把我的正面能量
What I'm doing is I'm transferring my positive energy

36
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:29,500
传给卡梅隆
into Cameron,

37
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:31,540
并把他所有的消极能量弄出来
and I'm taking out all the negative energy.

38
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:32,100
好的
Okay.

39
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:34,100
-你感觉到了吗 -感觉到了
- Now, do you feel that? - I do.

40
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:34,940
感觉很温暖吗
Does it feel warm?

41
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:35,780
确实很温暖
It does.

42
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:36,900
真的很温暖 米奇尔
It feels warm, Mitchell.

43
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:39,010
当然暖了 我们可是在泡热水浴呀
Imagine that. In a hot tub.

44
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,960
他开车经过时你准备干吗
What are you gonna do when he drives by?

45
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:44,890
我要叫他减速
I'm gonna tell him to slow down.

46
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:46,980
我认为你应该把他从车里拖出来
I think you should drag him out of his car,

47
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:49,040
然后我们轮流捶他的胃
and we all get turns punching him in the stomach

48
00:01:49,230 --> 00:01:50,500
捶到他吐
until he barfs.

49
00:01:50,530 --> 00:01:52,370
宝贝儿 我想我只会把他的车牌号
Honey, I think I'm just gonna turn over his license plate

50
00:01:52,370 --> 00:01:53,360
交给警察而已
to the police.

51
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:54,790
拜托
Please.

52
00:01:54,830 --> 00:01:56,731
叫个披萨再打给警察
Order a pizza and call the cops.

53
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,380
看谁到的快点
We'll see who gets here first.

54
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:01,080
自从他们在奥克蒙特设了减速坎
Ever since they put those speed bumps on Oakmont,

55
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:04,380
一些驾驶疯狂跑车的司机
some lunatic driver in a crazy sports car

56
00:02:04,380 --> 00:02:05,740
就开始在我们这条街上赛车
has been racing down our street,

57
00:02:05,740 --> 00:02:06,680
这太危险了
and it is dangerous.

58
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:09,380
我们这里有小孩 还坐婴儿车的婴儿
We've got kids here and babies in strollers

59
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,620
还有喜欢慢跑的妈妈们
and moms who like to jog.

60
00:02:10,852 --> 00:02:12,652
她必须每天跑步 不然会疯掉的
She has to run every day, or she goes crazy.

61
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,760
她就像一条边境牧羊犬
She's like a border collie.

62
00:02:14,020 --> 00:02:15,440
你把我比作一条狗吗
You're comparing me to a dog?

63
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,600
那可是世界上最聪明的狗
The smartest dogs in the world.

64
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,040
你们在干什么呢
What are you guys doing?

65
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,700
做那些警察不肯做的
What the cops won't.

66
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,720
我们在抓那些违章超速驾驶者
We are catching that speeder,

67
00:02:27,883 --> 00:02:30,253
等我们抓到他时 他满耳都会听到这个
and when we do, he's gonna get an earful of this.

68
00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:31,640
开慢点 混蛋
Slow down, jerk!

69
00:02:31,913 --> 00:02:32,603
好了 别激动
Oh! Okay! Easy.

70
00:02:32,603 --> 00:02:33,533
我的天啊 妈 你在干吗
Oh, my god. Mom, what are you doing?

71
00:02:33,580 --> 00:02:34,800
你干吗这么变态
Why are you being such a freak?!

72
00:02:34,940 --> 00:02:36,360
我是出于安全考虑才这么变态的
I am being a freak for safety.

73
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,680
而且我这么做都是为了你们
And I'm doing this for you,

74
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,720
因为我不希望你们发生任何不幸
because I don't want anything bad to happen to you.

75
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:41,140
这太丢人了
Well, it's embarrassing.

76
00:02:41,260 --> 00:02:42,240
妈 你得找点事干了
Mom, you need a life.

77
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:44,820
你为什么就不能在博物馆里做做自愿者
Why can't you just volunteer at the museum

78
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:46,540
或者给那些老人送送布丁呢
or bring pudding to old people?

79
00:02:46,584 --> 00:02:48,134
宝贝儿 要是说有谁丢人的话
Honey, if anybody's being embarrassing right now,

80
00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:48,580
那个人就是你
it's you.

81
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:51,260
卢克 我是你老爸
Luke, I am your father!

82
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,880
这让我想起了在产房的时候
That takes me back to the delivery room.

83
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:54,980
当你从你妈的私处钻出来时
That's what I said to you

84
00:02:55,165 --> 00:02:56,865
我就是这么跟你说的
when you were coming out of your mom's lady parts.

85
00:02:56,895 --> 00:02:58,725
天啊 老爸
Oh, my god, dad!

86
00:02:58,765 --> 00:03:00,435
我的天 我认识那俩女生
Oh, my god. I know those girls.

87
00:03:00,465 --> 00:03:02,435
- 怎么了 你觉得我们丢人吗 - 是的
- What? Are you ashamed of us? - Yes!

88
00:03:02,465 --> 00:03:04,165
《甜蜜高谷》咯
Ooh. Sweet Valley High!

89
00:03:04,205 --> 00:03:06,525
是那个住在第七街的女人打来的
This is that woman from the house on seventh street!

90
00:03:06,535 --> 00:03:06,945
好极了
Oh, good!

91
00:03:06,945 --> 00:03:08,605
是啊 如果我在下个月底前把房子卖出去
Yeah, if I sell it by the end of next month,

92
00:03:08,645 --> 00:03:10,996
我就能打败盖尔·索普 成为季度最佳销售员了
I dethrone Gil Thorpe as salesman of the quarter.

93
00:03:11,340 --> 00:03:12,460
太棒了 爸
That's awesome, dad.

94
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,640
确实棒极了
It is awesome.

95
00:03:14,856 --> 00:03:15,526
我是菲尔·邓菲
Phil Dunphy.

96
00:03:15,526 --> 00:03:16,966
超速驾驶的家伙来了 超速驾驶的家伙来了
That's the speeder! That's the speeder!

97
00:03:16,996 --> 00:03:19,026
开慢点 混蛋 开慢点
Slow down, jerk! Slow down!

98
00:03:19,026 --> 00:03:20,626
是的 不 是的 这太好了
Yeah. No. Yeah, that's great.

99
00:03:20,656 --> 00:03:22,096
好的 尽管问
Okay, fire away.

100
00:03:22,126 --> 00:03:23,996
-2urn801 -好的 给我地址就行
- 2-u-r-n-8-0-1. - Yeah. Oh, uh, just the address.

101
00:03:24,026 --> 00:03:25,927
-好的 一 零 -801 2urn 笔呢
- Yep. Okay. 1-0... - 8-0-1. 2-u-r-n. A pen.

102
00:03:25,967 --> 00:03:27,427
-一 北边 第七 -我给爸了
- 1...North...Seventh... - I gave it to dad.

103
00:03:29,537 --> 00:03:30,867
-ur -街
- U-r... - ...Street.

104
00:03:30,897 --> 00:03:32,037
-我的天 -好的 10-4
- Oh, god. - Okay. 10-4.

105
00:03:32,067 --> 00:03:35,207
这将是我自2006年以来我最走运的一年
This is gonna be my best year since 2006.

106
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,780
走吧 孩子 该送你去学校了
Let's go, kid. Back to the salt mine.

107
00:03:39,407 --> 00:03:41,548
不用了 杰 我今天骑自行车去上学
That's okay, Jay. I'm biking to school today.

108
00:03:41,608 --> 00:03:42,118
你真行
Good for you.

109
00:03:42,118 --> 00:03:43,358
学校里有一群很酷的小孩
There's a bunch of cool kids

110
00:03:43,358 --> 00:03:44,468
每天都骑自行车上学
who ride their bikes every day.

111
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:45,560
我也想骑
Thought I'd join them.

112
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,820
等等 等等 等等 等等
Hey, wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

113
00:03:47,820 --> 00:03:48,780
那是什么鬼东西
What the hell is that?

114
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:51,560
我的新自行车 妈妈昨天给我买的
My new bike. Mom got it for me yesterday.

115
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:52,980
很周到吧
Pretty sweet, huh?

116
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,020
辅助轮
Training wheels?

117
00:03:54,260 --> 00:03:55,880
质量很好的 还是订做的
Nice ones. Custom made.

118
00:03:56,180 --> 00:03:57,480
这种型号的自行车一般都不配辅助轮的
They don't usually come on bikes this size.

119
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:59,080
-歌洛莉亚 -怎么了
- Gloria! - What's wrong?

120
00:03:59,340 --> 00:04:00,280
你不会骑自行车吗
You don't know how to ride a bike?

121
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,760
我会骑这辆自行车
I know how to ride this bike.

122
00:04:02,020 --> 00:04:03,520
这辆车连斯蒂芬·霍金[肌肉萎缩的物理学家]都会骑
Stephen Hawking could ride that bike.

123
00:04:04,989 --> 00:04:06,489
我来了 怎么了
Ay. What happened?

124
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,360
他摔倒了吗
Did he fall?

125
00:04:07,520 --> 00:04:08,360
怎么可能摔倒
How could he fall?

126
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,780
你不能让他骑
You can't send him to school

127
00:04:09,780 --> 00:04:10,820
带辅助轮的自行车去上学
on a bike with training wheels.

128
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:11,600
同学们会笑他的
They'll make fun of him.

129
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,240
你没有教他怎么骑自行车吗
Didn't you teach him how to ride a bike?

130
00:04:13,500 --> 00:04:15,280
怎么教 我自己都不会骑自行车
How could I? I don't know how to ride a bike.

131
00:04:15,430 --> 00:04:16,750
十亿中国人都会做的事
2/3 of my house can't do

132
00:04:16,750 --> 00:04:18,070
我们家居然有三分之二的人都不会
what a billion Chinese do.

133
00:04:18,070 --> 00:04:20,440
我妈觉得骑自行车很危险
My mother thought that riding a bike was dangerous.

134
00:04:20,470 --> 00:04:22,610
她会说 "别人就会这样把你抓走的"
She would say, "that's how people grab you"!

135
00:04:22,620 --> 00:04:24,060
好吧 这样好了
Okay, this is how it's going down.

136
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,520
今天 我开车带你去学校
Today I'm driving you to school,

137
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,560
周末 我也给你买辆自行车
on the weekend, I'm buying you a bike,

138
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,620
我来教你们俩骑车
and I'm teaching both of you.

139
00:04:28,860 --> 00:04:29,860
我很紧张
I'm nervous...

140
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,080
但也很兴奋
but I'm excited.

141
00:04:31,141 --> 00:04:33,231
你们俩个去玩吧 我就免了
You two have fun. I pass.

142
00:04:33,231 --> 00:04:34,431
这根本不合理
It makes no sense.

143
00:04:34,461 --> 00:04:37,031
那个东西怎么可能立得住
There's no reason that thing should stay upright.

144
00:04:37,071 --> 00:04:38,131
你也不可能立得住
There's no reason you should stay upright,

145
00:04:38,171 --> 00:04:38,901
但事实就是可以
but it just works.

146
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:44,740
菲尔 快进来
Hey, Phil. Come on in.

147
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,140
劳拉 你好呀
Laura, good day.

148
00:04:46,382 --> 00:04:48,892
我超喜欢门口的设计
Well, I couldn't love this entry any more.

149
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:50,120
很有家的感觉
It's very welcoming.

150
00:04:50,402 --> 00:04:51,502
我十分钟后还有点事要办
Yeah, I got a thing in 10 minutes,

151
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,020
-所以我要快点搞掂这件事 -没问题
- so I have to make this quick. - Great.

152
00:04:53,302 --> 00:04:55,202
让我给你介绍一下
Um, let me run through

153
00:04:55,202 --> 00:04:57,143
我的销售三策略
my three-pronged approach to selling --

154
00:04:57,173 --> 00:04:58,793
我只需要一个策略 那就是把房子卖出去
I only need one prong -- sell the house.

155
00:04:58,793 --> 00:04:59,883
我不想跟那个女的一样
I don't want to be that yutz

156
00:04:59,883 --> 00:05:01,053
把房子的价位定的太高
who prices her house too high

157
00:05:01,140 --> 00:05:02,580
结果一整年都卖不出去
so it sits around for a year

158
00:05:02,653 --> 00:05:05,613
而那些在星期天无所事事的人
while every lookie-loo without something to do on Sundays

159
00:05:05,613 --> 00:05:07,013
都跑来看我的房子 窥探我的隐私
is going through my underwear drawer.

160
00:05:07,053 --> 00:05:08,073
佣金是多少
What's the number?

161
00:05:08,073 --> 00:05:09,303
我们需要考虑几个因素
Well, there are quite a few factors to take into --

162
00:05:09,343 --> 00:05:10,844
我只要一个数字
Need a number.

163
00:05:10,874 --> 00:05:12,724
我们规定的佣金是百分之一点四
Uh, we list at 1.4.

164
00:05:12,724 --> 00:05:14,084
底线是百分之一点二五
We take anything north of 1.25.

165
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:14,920
成交
Done!

166
00:05:16,020 --> 00:05:16,460
好极了
Great!

167
00:05:17,260 --> 00:05:19,160
我文件都准备好了 现在就能签
I got all the paperwork right here.

168
00:05:19,380 --> 00:05:20,820
别急 想要跟我进一步发展
Whoa, whoa, whoa. You got to buy me a beer

169
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:22,400
怎么也得先把我灌醉才行
before you can put your hand up my sweater.

170
00:05:22,860 --> 00:05:24,380
我可没有那种冒犯之意
Oh, I had no intention --

171
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,220
要是这周末开放日举行的成功
Put on a great open house this weekend,

172
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,380
零头就都是你的
the listing's yours.

173
00:05:29,180 --> 00:05:30,060
放马过来吧 劳拉
Bring it, Laura.

174
00:05:30,380 --> 00:05:32,720
想要考验我 我可是久经考验的
You want to test me? I've been tested my whole life.

175
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:34,780
别人到头来怎么输的都不知道
They could never find anything.

176
00:05:36,175 --> 00:05:38,735
那么星期天中午十二点到下午四点来举行开放日如何
So, uh, Sunday 12:00 to 4:00 for the open house?

177
00:05:38,735 --> 00:05:40,115
-这时间合适吗 -很好
- That works for you? - Great.

178
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:42,060
好的 如果你还有什么问题
Great. Oh, and if you have any questions

179
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:43,400
或是什么需要 打我电话就行了
or you need anything, just call.

180
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,120
跟我合作就像和朋友合作一样愉快
When you work with me, you're working with a friend.

181
00:05:45,220 --> 00:05:47,300
你真体贴 我很喜欢你
That is so sweet. I like you.

182
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:49,520
别让我失望 别到最后逼我炒了你
God, I hope I don't have to fire you.

183
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,380
你好 我是克莱尔 请留言
Hi. This is Claire. Leave a message.

184
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,100
亲爱的 是我
Hey, honey. It's me.

185
00:06:00,100 --> 00:06:00,980
我刚开完会
I just finished the meeting,

186
00:06:00,980 --> 00:06:02,820
她简直是完美客户
and she is the perfect client.

187
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:04,760
对价格不怎么计较
Realistic about the price...

188
00:06:04,837 --> 00:06:07,277
只想尽快把房子卖出去 她个性也很率真
she wants to sell fast, and she's a real character.

189
00:06:07,277 --> 00:06:08,487
你真应该见见她
You got to...meet her.

190
00:06:14,100 --> 00:06:16,600
不过她就快搬走了 我看还是算了吧
But she's moving soon, so what's the point?

191
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,560
你加班加到真晚
Wow, you worked late.

192
00:06:22,848 --> 00:06:24,998
是啊 难熬的一天 我只想马上坐下歇歇
Yes. Brutal day. I just want to sit.

193
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:26,380
正好 莉莉睡着了
Perfect. Lily's asleep.

194
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:27,700
贝瑞待会跟咱们一起泡热水浴
Barry's meeting us in the hot tub.

195
00:06:27,820 --> 00:06:28,460
要是你压力太大
If you're feeling stressed,

196
00:06:28,719 --> 00:06:29,389
他可以给你灵气按摩一下
he could give you a treatment.

197
00:06:29,389 --> 00:06:30,209
我看还是算了吧
Ah, that's all right.

198
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,920
我明天约了赤脚医生
I have an appointment with Dr. Bigfoot tomorrow.

199
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,520
好了好了 又来了
Okay. Here comes the judge.

200
00:06:34,380 --> 00:06:35,900
灵气按摩什么的都是骗人的 小卡
Reiki is a bunch of nonsense, Cam.

201
00:06:35,909 --> 00:06:36,909
那人就是个疯子
That guy is a nut.

202
00:06:36,939 --> 00:06:38,109
你每次都这样
You do this every time.

203
00:06:38,140 --> 00:06:38,940
每当我们结识一个新朋友
We meet a new friend,

204
00:06:38,980 --> 00:06:40,120
只要他们说出一件你不喜欢的事
they say one thing you don't like,

205
00:06:40,149 --> 00:06:41,080
你就会无情的把他们踢出局
and you just write 'em off.

206
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,000
我哪有
I do not!

207
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,520
没有吗 你忘了那个"但是可是雷切尔"了
Oh, really? What about "but yet Rachel"?

208
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:46,160
我很想去 但是可是 我不怎么喜欢逛公园
"I'd love to go, but yet, I don't feel like parking".

209
00:06:46,300 --> 00:06:47,380
要不就说"但是" 要不就说"可是"
It's either "but" or "yet",

210
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:47,820
没有放在一块说的
not both.

211
00:06:47,970 --> 00:06:49,420
你该庆幸到目前为止还没人来教训你
You're lucky no one's kicked your butt yet.

212
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:50,460
那托马斯又怎么说
What about Thomas?

213
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,580
你把他踢出局就是因为
You wrote him off because

214
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,250
他先上主菜 后上沙拉
he serves the salad after the meal,

215
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:55,360
顺便说一句 这在欧洲是很正常的
which, by the way, is very common in Europe.

216
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:57,400
他是从欧洲哪来的 自命不凡斯坦国吗
What part of Europe is he from? Pretentious-stan?

217
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,060
好吧
Okay, fine.

218
00:06:58,140 --> 00:06:59,820
继续指责吧 别交任何朋友
Keep judging. Don't let anyone in.

219
00:06:59,820 --> 00:07:00,540
我也可以少管点
I could care less.

220
00:07:00,540 --> 00:07:02,120
你是想说你才懒得管呢吧
I think you mean you couldn't care less,

221
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,100
因为你要说"可以少管点"
because if you could care less,

222
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:04,040
就证明你还是管了
that means that you care a little bit.

223
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,100
好吧 我要去泡热水浴了
All right. I'm going to the hot tub.

224
00:07:05,200 --> 00:07:06,320
要是我在这里多待一分钟
If I stay in here one more minute,

225
00:07:06,541 --> 00:07:08,181
我的头就真的要爆了
my head is literally gonna explode.

226
00:07:08,181 --> 00:07:09,551
我希望不会 因为要是真的会爆的话
Well, I hope not, because if you mean "literally" --

227
00:07:09,581 --> 00:07:11,622
我待在自己家里都没有安全感
I don't feel safe in my own home!

228
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,760
菲尔 亲爱的 帮我一把
Phil, honey, I need your help.

229
00:07:15,992 --> 00:07:16,762
帮你干吗
With what?

230
00:07:16,780 --> 00:07:19,640
什么东西是违章超速者无法躲开的
What is the one thing a speeder can't outrun?

231
00:07:19,732 --> 00:07:22,142
子弹 激光
Ooh. Bullets. A laser.

232
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:24,260
我知道了 大炮 老爸 快帮我想想
Oh, I know -- a falcon! Dad, jump in.

233
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:25,000
时机不对
Not a good time.

234
00:07:25,100 --> 00:07:26,660
-雷射炮 -这个给力
- A laser falcon! - That's awesome.

235
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:28,480
答案是 羞愧感
Shame.

236
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:32,640
"使你的邻居们变得迟钝"
"Slow down your neighbors"!?

237
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,440
不是这个意思 "放慢速度"
No. "Slow down" --

238
00:07:35,820 --> 00:07:36,920
是对违章超速者说的
talking to the speeder --

239
00:07:37,220 --> 00:07:38,420
是谁要对那违章超速者说呢
Who's talking to the speeder?

240
00:07:38,700 --> 00:07:39,420
你的邻居们
Your neighbors.

241
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,860
才不是这个意思呢
It doesn't say that.

242
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:42,940
没错 那上面只写着"使你的邻居们变得迟钝"
Yeah, it just says "Slow down your neighbors"!

243
00:07:43,140 --> 00:07:44,760
-菲尔 -我懂你想表达什么
- Phil. - I know what you were going for,

244
00:07:44,824 --> 00:07:46,594
可你那标牌上写的就是"使你的邻居们变得迟钝"
but now all I can see is "slow down your neighbors"!

245
00:07:46,624 --> 00:07:49,204
你们都错了 因为这再清楚不过了
Well, you're all wrong, 'cause this is incredibly clear.

246
00:07:49,204 --> 00:07:50,464
而且这很重要
And it's really important.

247
00:07:50,464 --> 00:07:52,574
我们需要在街区贴满这些告示
We need to put these signs up all over the neighborhood.

248
00:07:52,574 --> 00:07:54,224
这可不像你啊 这是胆小鬼做的事
I don't know. It seems kind of cowardly.

249
00:07:54,474 --> 00:07:56,835
为什么不直接打匿名电话给警方呢
Why don't you just make an anonymous call to the police?

250
00:07:56,875 --> 00:07:59,345
我老早打过了 可他们什么忙都帮不上
I called the police, and they were totally unhelpful.

251
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:00,640
我早就说啦
Surprise. Surprise.

252
00:08:00,915 --> 00:08:02,375
菲尔 你到底站不站在我这边
Phil, come on. Are you with me or not?

253
00:08:02,375 --> 00:08:03,255
我当然站在你这边
Of course I'm with you.

254
00:08:03,255 --> 00:08:04,885
不然呢 难道站在那人这边
Who else would I be with? This guy?

255
00:08:04,915 --> 00:08:06,315
我和那人又没有任何瓜葛
I have no connection to this guy.

256
00:08:06,345 --> 00:08:07,445
-很好 帮我把它贴出去 -不
- Good! - No!

257
00:08:09,060 --> 00:08:09,460
好吧
Fine.

258
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,400
在你炮轰我之前 我要说
Before you judge me,

259
00:08:11,526 --> 00:08:13,556
我已经整整七个季度
I have come in second to Gil Thorpe

260
00:08:13,586 --> 00:08:16,396
都在季度最佳销售员的评比上输给盖尔·索普而位居第二
for salesman of the quarter seven quarters in a row.

261
00:08:16,940 --> 00:08:17,340
整整七个季度
Seven.

262
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:19,860
没人会记得第二名是谁
Nobody remembers second best.

263
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,780
人人都爱迈克尔·乔丹
Oh, yeah, everybody loves Michael Jordan,

264
00:08:21,780 --> 00:08:23,020
可有谁会想起斯科蒂·皮蓬
but nobody thinks of Scottie Pippen.

265
00:08:24,140 --> 00:08:25,780
我会记得他的唯一原因是
The only reason I remember him

266
00:08:25,780 --> 00:08:27,620
他跟我最爱的音乐剧同名
is because he's named after my favorite musical.

267
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:32,720
-米奇 -是贝瑞啊
- Oh, hey, Mitch. - Hey. It's Barry.

268
00:08:33,067 --> 00:08:33,747
我只是来通知你们
Uh, I just want to let you guys know

269
00:08:33,747 --> 00:08:35,677
你们有一个自动洒水器在漏水
you got a sprinkler head that's leaking out there.

270
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:37,520
谢谢你 贝瑞 我会通知园丁的
Oh. Thanks, Barry. I'll let the gardener know.

271
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:40,560
好的 又或者我可以朝它舞动一下我的双手
All right. Or maybe I could just wave my hands over it

272
00:08:40,560 --> 00:08:42,800
用我的灵气修好它
and heal it that way.

273
00:08:43,380 --> 00:08:43,860
只是玩笑
I'm joking.

274
00:08:45,740 --> 00:08:47,740
天呐 差点被你骗到
Oh, god. That was a good one.

275
00:08:47,940 --> 00:08:48,840
听着 不用担心
Look, don't worry about it.

276
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,060
我看得出来 只要我一开始谈灵气
As soon as I started talking about reiki,

277
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:52,200
你就觉得我的精神也许有点不太正常
I could tell you thought I might be a little nutty.

278
00:08:53,140 --> 00:08:54,160
有这么明显吗
Was I that obvious?

279
00:08:54,300 --> 00:08:55,460
你整天都冲我翻白眼
You roll your eyes a lot.

280
00:08:57,019 --> 00:08:58,249
给你说中了
Uh, no, it's true.

281
00:08:58,289 --> 00:08:59,419
我的确爱翻白眼
It's true, no.

282
00:08:59,459 --> 00:09:00,549
我曾经看到一张自己
I-I once saw a picture of myself

283
00:09:00,980 --> 00:09:02,200
在朋友的诵诗比赛上拍的照片
at a friend's poetry slam,

284
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:04,300
结果照片里能看到的只有我的眼白
and all you could see were the whites of my eyes.

285
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,700
我看上去就像孤女安妮
Yeah, I looked like Little Orphan Annie.

286
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:08,820
那部动画片
The cartoon.

287
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,800
总而言之 如有冒犯之处我很抱歉
Anyway, I'm sorry if I offended you.

288
00:09:10,939 --> 00:09:11,970
别 不用道歉
No. Don't apologize.

289
00:09:12,010 --> 00:09:14,590
唯一会让我觉得有所冒犯的事
Look, I -- only thing that offends me

290
00:09:14,590 --> 00:09:16,720
就是一个不能无法面对真实的自己的人
is a man who doesn't live in his own truth.

291
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:18,840
而且我知道你现在正很努力地
And I appreciate how hard you're trying

292
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,200
不去翻白眼 我为此表示感谢
not to roll your eyes right now.

293
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,900
因为我就快晕过去了
'Cause I'm about to pass out!

294
00:09:21,900 --> 00:09:22,830
我看出来了
I see it.

295
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,500
我准备好了
Okay! I'm ready!

296
00:09:29,041 --> 00:09:30,571
他穿了些什么东西
What the hell's he wearing?

297
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,520
保护软垫 还得再加点吗
Protection pads. He needs more?

298
00:09:32,580 --> 00:09:34,580
我们只是学骑车而已 又不是训练警犬
We're riding bikes. We're not training police dogs.

299
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:37,100
好了 孩子 过来 上来吧
All right, kid. Come on. Get on.

300
00:09:38,160 --> 00:09:39,040
上车
On board.

301
00:09:40,471 --> 00:09:41,482
好样的
Attaboy.

302
00:09:41,500 --> 00:09:42,160
好了 准备好了吗
All right, we ready?

303
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:43,420
骑
Ride!

304
00:09:44,460 --> 00:09:45,380
小心点 小乖乖
Be careful, papi.

305
00:09:45,460 --> 00:09:46,040
别理她
Ignore her.

306
00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:47,940
那孩子连在机场的
I've seen the kid fall down

307
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:49,520
自动人行道上都能摔跤
on that moving sidewalk at the airport,

308
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,680
所以我没抱太大希望
so I didn't have high hopes.

309
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:56,000
可谁能会到呢 那孩子天生是个骑车的料
But what do you know? The kid was a natural.

310
00:09:56,540 --> 00:09:58,600
妈妈 这太简单了
Mom! It's so easy!

311
00:09:59,400 --> 00:09:59,460
太棒了 曼尼
Bravo, Manny!

312
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:00,540
我就跟你说嘛
I told you!

313
00:10:00,713 --> 00:10:02,643
小心地上的坑
Be careful with the bump!

314
00:10:02,683 --> 00:10:04,383
等等 那人是谁
Hey, wait a minute. Who's that guy?

315
00:10:04,413 --> 00:10:05,743
杰 他会抓走曼尼的
Jay, he's gonna grab him!

316
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:07,920
没人会被抓走 那只是个邻居而已
Oh, no one's grabbing anyone. It's a neighbor.

317
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:09,600
可歌洛莉亚
Gloria, on the other hand,

318
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,140
简直是个天生的悲剧
was a natural disaster.

319
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:13,960
在骑车之前你要先做三件事
There are three things you want to do before you ride.

320
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:14,600
曼尼说
Manny.

321
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:16,980
检查鞋带 调整后视镜
Check your shoelaces, adjust your mirror,

322
00:10:17,224 --> 00:10:18,264
还有测试车铃
and test your bell.

323
00:10:18,294 --> 00:10:19,814
好的 鞋带系好了
Okay. Shoelaces tied...

324
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,180
后视镜视野不错
the mirror is good...

325
00:10:22,460 --> 00:10:23,800
车铃也很正常
...the bell is ringing.

326
00:10:24,300 --> 00:10:25,020
好了 然后呢
Okay, now what?

327
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:25,580
骑啊
Ride.

328
00:10:26,024 --> 00:10:27,065
别别别 杰
Ay, no, no, no, Jay.

329
00:10:27,095 --> 00:10:28,635
别推我 我可不想受伤
Don't push me! I don't want to get hurt!

330
00:10:28,695 --> 00:10:30,095
相信我 不会让你受伤的
Trust me. I'm not gonna hurt you.

331
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,160
你就像一幅名画
You're a work of art.

332
00:10:31,260 --> 00:10:31,900
要是被划伤
If you get scratched,

333
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:32,920
那可就掉价了
the value goes down.

334
00:10:32,920 --> 00:10:34,420
我是为了缓和气氛搞笑一下
I'm making a joke to lighten the mood.

335
00:10:34,540 --> 00:10:35,380
一点都不好笑
It's not working!

336
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,760
你就骑吧
Let's just do this.

337
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,200
好吧
Okay.

338
00:10:39,340 --> 00:10:39,700
慢点
Slowly.

339
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:41,800
杰 慢点啊
Jay, slowly.

340
00:10:43,086 --> 00:10:44,526
放松 你摔不了
Relax. You're not gonna fall.

341
00:10:44,556 --> 00:10:46,396
我抓着你呢 把脚放在踏板上
I got you. Put your feet on the pedals.

342
00:10:46,426 --> 00:10:47,336
眼睛看着路
Now look where you're going.

343
00:10:47,420 --> 00:10:48,180
看着路啊
Look where you're going!

344
00:10:48,220 --> 00:10:49,160
不 我要摔了 我要摔了
No, I'm falling. I'm falling.

345
00:10:49,386 --> 00:10:50,386
目视前方 去吧去吧
Look straight ahead. Go, go, go.

346
00:10:50,416 --> 00:10:51,686
-踩踏板 -不要 杰
- Pedal! - No, Jay!

347
00:10:51,716 --> 00:10:53,486
你一个劲儿按铃干吗
What are you ringing the bell for?

348
00:10:53,516 --> 00:10:55,156
你怎么能放手呢 杰
Ay! Why you let me go, Jay?!

349
00:10:55,900 --> 00:10:56,580
不对不对 踩踏板
No, no! Pedal!

350
00:10:56,760 --> 00:10:58,600
目视前方 看着路
Look where you're going! Look where you're going!

351
00:10:59,757 --> 00:11:01,777
我要宰了你 杰
I'm gonna kill you, Jay!

352
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,720
好了 今天学得不错
Okay. Good day's work.

353
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:05,880
我们去珠宝店逛逛怎么样
What do you say we hit the jewelry store?

354
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:13,320
菲尔
Phil?

355
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:15,080
劳拉
Laura!

356
00:11:16,540 --> 00:11:17,360
你在干吗
What are you doing?

357
00:11:18,660 --> 00:11:20,320
把这个告示牌 拆下来
Taking this...sign down!

358
00:11:20,428 --> 00:11:22,788
我发现上面写着你的车牌号
I recognized your license plate.

359
00:11:22,828 --> 00:11:24,258
这也太荒唐了
This is ridiculous!

360
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:26,040
我知道 整个小区都贴满了告示牌
I know. They're all over the neighborhood.

361
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,860
什么疯子会干这种蠢事
What kind of lunatic does something like this?

362
00:11:27,900 --> 00:11:29,160
谁知道呀
Who knows?

363
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,540
也许是某个无所事事的家庭主妇
It's probably some bored housewife

364
00:11:31,799 --> 00:11:33,399
对丈夫无爱 对生活怨恨
who hates her husband and hates her life,

365
00:11:33,439 --> 00:11:35,559
于是就把气撒在其他人身上
so she takes it out on the rest of us!

366
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:37,329
要么就是家里太平无事
Or things are so good at home,

367
00:11:37,359 --> 00:11:38,759
所以她就出门来找茬
she's out looking for problems.

368
00:11:38,940 --> 00:11:39,620
相信我
Trust me.

369
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:41,380
这种女人绝对是欲求不满
This woman needs to get laid.

370
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:43,240
我觉得不是这个原因
I don't think that's the issue.

371
00:11:43,900 --> 00:11:45,840
拿着 把这个贴上
Here. Stick this up.

372
00:11:45,940 --> 00:11:47,320
这是老娘留给她的口信
Send her a message from me.

373
00:11:48,700 --> 00:11:49,220
好的
Okay.

374
00:11:54,700 --> 00:11:55,520
天啊
Oh, my gosh.

375
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:56,580
我的告示牌怎么成这样了
What happened to my sign?

376
00:11:56,640 --> 00:11:57,500
不知道啊
I don't know!

377
00:11:57,900 --> 00:11:59,460
我把它钉好后就走开了
I put it up, I went away,

378
00:11:59,780 --> 00:12:01,920
等我回来时 就已经成两半了
I came back -- it was in pieces!

379
00:12:02,380 --> 00:12:03,540
这也太疯狂了
This is so crazy.

380
00:12:03,860 --> 00:12:04,340
是疯狂啊
Crazy!!

381
00:12:05,140 --> 00:12:06,900
克莱尔 这件事本身就是疯狂的
Claire, this whole thing is crazy.

382
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:09,120
也许我们应该作出点让步
Maybe we should back off a little bit.

383
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:11,020
菲尔 绝不
You know what, Phil? No.

384
00:12:11,211 --> 00:12:12,782
我才不让步
I am not gonna back off.

385
00:12:13,020 --> 00:12:15,980
知道吗 我这么做是为了咱们街区居民的安全
Okay? I am doing this for the safety of our neighborhood.

386
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:29,300
这是怎么回事啊
Well, what's going on here?

387
00:12:29,400 --> 00:12:30,220
小卡
Hey, Cam.

388
00:12:30,260 --> 00:12:31,740
我正在用内功清除他体内的负面能量
Just getting rid of some negative energy.

389
00:12:31,920 --> 00:12:34,040
估计你得清到周二 等你清完我们再回来
Oh, well, in that case, we'll be back Tuesday.

390
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:36,660
米奇 你已经没事了
You're all set, Mitch.

391
00:12:37,813 --> 00:12:39,373
贝瑞
Barry.

392
00:12:39,413 --> 00:12:41,483
-伙计 感觉真舒服啊 -是吧
- Oh, man, that was -- that was great. - Yeah?

393
00:12:42,580 --> 00:12:43,360
别忘了合十礼 伙计
Namaste, man.

394
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:45,000
-阿弥陀佛 -阿弥陀佛
- Namaste. - Namaste.

395
00:12:45,214 --> 00:12:46,984
好了 我不打扰你们了
All right. I'm gonna get out of your hair.

396
00:12:47,024 --> 00:12:48,694
我去洗个快澡
I'm gonna grab a quick tub

397
00:12:48,694 --> 00:12:50,764
再看看能不能弄点吃的
and see if I can rustle up some food.

398
00:12:50,900 --> 00:12:52,140
不 别弄了
Oh, no. Hey, don't rustle.

399
00:12:52,180 --> 00:12:53,520
我们今晚开伙 你过来一起吃吧
We're making dinner tonight. You're coming.

400
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:54,540
是啊 来吧
Yeah, come down.

401
00:12:54,804 --> 00:12:56,074
-这样好吗 -当然了
- Yeah? - Yes.

402
00:12:56,160 --> 00:12:56,980
谢谢你 米奇
Thank you, Mitch.

403
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:58,500
看见没 已经见效了
See? It's working already.

404
00:13:00,660 --> 00:13:01,040
阿弥陀佛
Namaste.

405
00:13:05,780 --> 00:13:06,220
你想说什么
What?

406
00:13:06,540 --> 00:13:07,740
你知道我要说什么
You know what I'm looking for.

407
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:09,860
-他人很好 -不是这句
- He's a very nice guy. - That's not it.

408
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:11,140
抱歉 我之前的判断有点仓促
I'm sorry I made a snap judgment.

409
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:11,920
也不是这个哦
Still not it.

410
00:13:11,940 --> 00:13:12,580
你是对的
You were right.

411
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:13,880
这就对了
There she is.

412
00:13:18,620 --> 00:13:19,480
米奇尔 你好
Hello, Mitchell.

413
00:13:19,816 --> 00:13:21,816
高太太 我是卡梅隆
Oh. Mrs. Ko. I'm Cameron.

414
00:13:21,846 --> 00:13:23,186
米奇尔的娇妻
Mitchell's the other one.

415
00:13:23,216 --> 00:13:24,516
你来这有事吗
What are you doing here?

416
00:13:24,546 --> 00:13:26,716
我刚带人去看了楼上的公寓
I just finished showing the apartment upstairs.

417
00:13:26,756 --> 00:13:27,837
什么意思 那贝瑞呢
What do you mean? What about Barry?

418
00:13:27,837 --> 00:13:28,517
贝瑞是谁
Who's Barry?

419
00:13:28,557 --> 00:13:29,267
新来的房客
The new tenant.

420
00:13:29,460 --> 00:13:30,940
里面没人住 这是间空房
Nobody living up there. It's empty.

421
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:33,640
-可是 -你要是看见楼上有人就打我电话
- But... - You see anybody up there, you call me.

422
00:13:34,880 --> 00:13:35,820
是我丈夫
My husband.

423
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:36,940
我来了
I'm coming!

424
00:13:37,427 --> 00:13:40,797
你该庆幸法律不让你俩结婚
You two so lucky they don't let you get married.

425
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:59,380
这不是我的问题
The problem wasn't me.

426
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:01,460
都怪杰 他教得也太烂了
It was Jay. He's a very bad teacher.

427
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:02,280
太霸道了
Very bossy.

428
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,880
人家不喜欢那样嘛
I don't respond to that.

429
00:14:04,180 --> 00:14:06,000
我喜欢有绅士风度 关爱有加的人
I need somebody gentle, nurturing,

430
00:14:06,580 --> 00:14:07,340
要像女性一样温柔
like a woman.

431
00:14:09,580 --> 00:14:11,440
歌洛莉亚 你好吗
Hey. Gloria. What's up?

432
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:13,140
你能教我骑自行车吗
Can you teach me how to ride a bike?

433
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:14,880
你竟然不会骑车
You can't ride a bike?

434
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:16,000
惹人怜爱啊
I love that about you.

435
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,700
我一直觉得你完美无缺呢
I was beginning to think you didn't have any flaws.

436
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:18,940
听着 我很想教你
Listen, I wish I could,

437
00:14:19,020 --> 00:14:20,160
不过我约人看房要迟到了
but I'm late for an open house.

438
00:14:21,820 --> 00:14:23,040
我可以教你
I could teach you.

439
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:24,580
-真的吗 -当然了
- Really? - Sure.

440
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:26,260
我可是单车帝
I'm a great bike rider.

441
00:14:26,500 --> 00:14:28,120
我教过好多朋友呢
I've taught a bunch of my friends.

442
00:14:29,080 --> 00:14:30,780
我从没教过别人任何东西
I never taught anyone anything.

443
00:14:31,331 --> 00:14:34,261
但我被人放了鸽子 正闲得慌呢
But my playdate canceled, so I was wide open.

444
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:38,820
贝瑞
Barry?

445
00:14:39,260 --> 00:14:39,700
在
Yep!

446
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,860
是你啊 卡梅隆
Oh. Hey, Cameron.

447
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,040
你在里面干吗
What are you doing in there?

448
00:14:48,260 --> 00:14:49,620
我只是整理一下
I'm just tidying up a little bit.

449
00:14:50,020 --> 00:14:50,540
怎么了
What's up?

450
00:14:50,920 --> 00:14:52,980
你住在我女儿的公主城堡里吗
Are you living in our daughter's princess castle?!

451
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:53,640
什么
What?!

452
00:14:54,300 --> 00:14:55,300
少来了 别开玩笑了
No, don't be ridiculous.

453
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:57,120
我住在这儿 兄弟
I'm living in here, man.

454
00:14:57,420 --> 00:14:58,060
只是睡在那里面
I'm sleeping in there.

455
00:14:58,500 --> 00:15:00,300
你说你刚搬到楼上
You said you had just moved in upstairs.

456
00:15:00,593 --> 00:15:02,053
不 我是说我刚搬过来
No, I said I just moved in.

457
00:15:02,963 --> 00:15:05,093
对不起 我以为这暗示了
I'm -- I'm sorry. I thought it was implied...

458
00:15:05,133 --> 00:15:06,433
暗示你住在玩具屋里
that you're living in a dollhouse?

459
00:15:06,463 --> 00:15:07,693
好了 咱别在大庭广众之下的说这个了
Okay. Let's not do this outside.

460
00:15:07,733 --> 00:15:08,693
好吗
All right?

461
00:15:08,733 --> 00:15:09,243
要不要到屋里去
You want to go inside

462
00:15:09,243 --> 00:15:10,173
以成人的方式讨论这个问题
and talk about this like two adults?

463
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:11,480
好的 就这样吧
Yes. Let's do that.

464
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:12,120
好
Great.

465
00:15:12,860 --> 00:15:13,320
不
No --

466
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:15,220
-不是这间屋 -没关系 我刚打扫过
- No! - It's okay. I just cleaned up.

467
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:18,980
快进来
Come on in.

468
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:23,580
天哪 你还真住在这里面
Oh, my God! You are living in here!

469
00:15:24,540 --> 00:15:25,540
进来再说
Inside voices.

470
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:31,340
贝瑞
Barry.

471
00:15:32,880 --> 00:15:33,920
你是不是无家可归
Are you homeless?

472
00:15:34,900 --> 00:15:35,480
无家可归
Homeless?

473
00:15:36,340 --> 00:15:37,360
你疯了吗
Are you insane?

474
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:39,960
看看这里 你看
Look at this place.I mean...

475
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:42,320
好吧 没想到我不得不说出这种话
Okay. I can't even believe I'm having to say this,

476
00:15:42,435 --> 00:15:45,236
不过 你不能住在这
but you can't -- you can't stay here.

477
00:15:45,266 --> 00:15:46,406
兄弟
Oh, boy.

478
00:15:46,436 --> 00:15:47,506
是不是因为
This is about the --

479
00:15:47,536 --> 00:15:48,706
我帮米奇尔做内功排毒那件事
the body work I did with Mitchell, isn't it?

480
00:15:48,736 --> 00:15:50,176
要是你因此觉得不爽的话
'Cause I would understand if that was...

481
00:15:50,206 --> 00:15:50,916
我可以理解
bothering you.

482
00:15:50,916 --> 00:15:53,146
不是 而是因为你居然住在小女孩的玩具屋里
No. You are living in a little girl's toy,

483
00:15:53,260 --> 00:15:54,660
所以你必须搬出去
and you have to move out.

484
00:15:54,676 --> 00:15:56,346
好吧 但这着实会让晚宴变的很尴尬
Okay, well, this is gonna make dinner really awkward.

485
00:15:56,376 --> 00:15:58,087
没有晚宴 晚宴取消了
There's no dinner! Dinner is off!

486
00:15:58,160 --> 00:15:59,400
明白了吗 快点 走吧
Okay? Now, come on. Let's go.

487
00:15:59,687 --> 00:16:02,317
不 不 不 别碰我 我不喜欢别人碰我
No, no, no. Don't touch me. I don't like to be touched.

488
00:16:02,760 --> 00:16:03,980
可你是个按摩师啊
You're a massage therapist.

489
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:06,060
我是灵气大师 基本不需要触碰
I'm a reiki master. Very little touching.

490
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:08,220
好吧 贝瑞 听我说
Okay, Barry. Listen to me.

491
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:08,740
你说
Okay.

492
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,480
你是个好人
You're a very nice man.

493
00:16:11,120 --> 00:16:12,440
我和米奇尔都很喜欢你
Mitchell and I like you very much.

494
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:12,800
谢谢
Thank you.

495
00:16:12,860 --> 00:16:13,860
但我 不客气
But I'm -- you're welcome.

496
00:16:14,340 --> 00:16:16,120
我要抓着你的手
I'm going to take your hand...

497
00:16:16,520 --> 00:16:17,280
我就要抓
Yes, I am.

498
00:16:18,608 --> 00:16:20,908
别像盯野狼一样盯我看 我又不是犬科动物
Don't give me the coyote look. I'm not a canine.

499
00:16:20,938 --> 00:16:23,238
我们一起离开这里
We're gonna walk out of here together.

500
00:16:23,278 --> 00:16:24,858
没人会伤害你
Nobody's gonna hurt you.

501
00:16:24,858 --> 00:16:26,098
你这样做不会有好结果的
Oh, this is not gonna end very well.

502
00:16:26,128 --> 00:16:27,098
把手给我
Give me your hand.

503
00:16:35,569 --> 00:16:36,569
小卡
Cam?!

504
00:16:36,609 --> 00:16:38,679
米奇尔 快报警
Mitchell! Call 911!

505
00:16:38,709 --> 00:16:39,639
怎么了
What's happening?!

506
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:40,540
贝瑞是个疯子
Barry's a nut!

507
00:16:40,709 --> 00:16:41,979
他一直住在莉莉的城堡里
He's been living in Lily's castle!

508
00:16:42,009 --> 00:16:42,880
什么
What?

509
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,000
你好啊 米奇尔
Hey, Mitchell!

510
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:46,500
上帝啊 我还以为他住在楼上呢
Oh, my god! I thought he was living upstairs!

511
00:16:46,760 --> 00:16:47,840
快去报警就是了
Just call the police!

512
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:49,640
你想让我停下来把整件事讲给你听吗
Do you want me to stop and give you the whole story?!

513
00:16:50,020 --> 00:16:51,760
我从没 我从没说过我住楼上
I never -- I never said upstairs.

514
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:52,260
米奇尔
Mitchell!

515
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:55,410
快报警 别掐我
Call 911! Stop pinching!

516
00:16:55,410 --> 00:16:56,950
好吧 顺便跟你说
Okay. And just for the record,

517
00:16:56,980 --> 00:16:58,851
我是对的
I was right!

518
00:16:58,881 --> 00:17:01,251
我还是觉得你不应该对别人评头论足
I still don't think you should judge people!

519
00:17:01,291 --> 00:17:02,821
我说放开我
I said get off me!

520
00:17:02,900 --> 00:17:03,520
好吧 歌洛莉亚
Okay, Gloria.

521
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,400
是什么让你害怕骑车
What scares you about riding a bike?

522
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:07,440
失去控制然后跌倒
Losing control and falling down.

523
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:09,160
很好 还有吗
Great. What else?

524
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:11,040
怕有人把我抓走
Somebody grabbing me?

525
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:12,780
真怪异的想法 还有吗
That's weird. What else?

526
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:15,520
-看上去很傻 -好吧
- Looking foolish. - Okay.

527
00:17:15,660 --> 00:17:18,020
你看 你就是被这些消极的想法牵绊住了
See, all these bad thoughts are holding you back.

528
00:17:18,320 --> 00:17:20,220
那我们怎么才能摆脱那些消极的想法呢
So how do we get rid of these bad thoughts?

529
00:17:21,962 --> 00:17:22,972
把他们射出来
We shoot 'em out!

530
00:17:22,972 --> 00:17:24,242
不要 你敢
No, don't you dare!

531
00:17:24,272 --> 00:17:25,242
快骑
Ride!

532
00:17:25,272 --> 00:17:26,372
你敢
Don't you dare!

533
00:17:26,412 --> 00:17:27,973
-快骑 -卢克 快停下
- Ride! - Luke, stop it!

534
00:17:28,013 --> 00:17:29,083
-不要 -我说快骑
- No! - I said ride!

535
00:17:29,113 --> 00:17:30,213
不要 不要
No, no!

536
00:17:30,253 --> 00:17:31,853
-快骑 -我要找你妈告状
- Ride! - I'm gonna tell your mother!

537
00:17:31,883 --> 00:17:33,153
说什么 说你在骑车吗
What? That you're riding a bike?

538
00:17:33,183 --> 00:17:35,083
不是 是说你
No, that you're...

539
00:17:35,123 --> 00:17:36,553
太棒了 我会骑车了
Yes! I'm riding the bike!

540
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:40,920
那是世界上最棒的感觉了
It was the greatest feeling in the world.

541
00:17:41,363 --> 00:17:42,393
卢克是对的
Luke was right.

542
00:17:42,423 --> 00:17:44,664
没有什么可害怕的
There was nothing to be afraid of.

543
00:17:54,844 --> 00:17:55,974
下车 下车
Get off the bike! Get off the bike!

544
00:17:55,974 --> 00:17:56,704
-把车给我 给我 -别抓我
- Give it to me! Give it to me! - Ay, don't grab me!

545
00:17:56,704 --> 00:17:58,435
不 不 不 别抓我
No, no! No, don't grab me!

546
00:17:58,435 --> 00:18:00,105
走开 走开 走开
Go, go, go, go, go! Go!

547
00:18:00,145 --> 00:18:01,975
鞋带 后视镜
Laces, mirror...

548
00:18:02,015 --> 00:18:03,245
车铃
bell.

549
00:18:03,275 --> 00:18:04,445
减速 你个混蛋
Slow down, jerk!

550
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:11,540
感谢二位的光临 很高兴认识你们
Thanks so much for coming. It was great to meet you both.

551
00:18:12,020 --> 00:18:13,000
祝你们一切顺利
Have a good one!

552
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:15,740
再见
See you later.

553
00:18:17,420 --> 00:18:18,300
进展怎么样
How's it going?

554
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:19,700
很好 来了很多人
Hey, great. Lots of people.

555
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,520
听着 我在想那些标志的事
Listen, I was thinking about those signs.

556
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:22,500
使你的邻居们变得迟钝
"Slow down your neighbors"!

557
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:23,500
事实上 我觉得那个标示的意思是
Oh, actually, I think they meant

558
00:18:23,500 --> 00:18:24,700
"减速" 是对你说的
"slow down" -- talking to you --

559
00:18:24,780 --> 00:18:25,900
谁说的呢 "你的邻居们"
Who's talking? "Your neighbors".

560
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:26,580
随便了
Anyway...

561
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,440
你觉不觉得
Yeah, um, you think maybe it's possible

562
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,720
你在居民区
that you do drive a little too fast

563
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:30,780
开得有点太快了
in a residential neighborhood

564
00:18:30,780 --> 00:18:32,420
这周围还有孩子 也许
with children present, maybe, or...

565
00:18:32,420 --> 00:18:33,760
菲尔 我很感谢你的关心
Oh, Phil, I appreciate your concern,

566
00:18:33,760 --> 00:18:34,780
但是问题不在我
but I am not the problem.

567
00:18:35,077 --> 00:18:36,047
而是那个写标示的疯婆子
It's the crazy sign lady

568
00:18:36,077 --> 00:18:37,447
她连个完整的句子都不会写
who can't put a sentence together --

569
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,520
那才是你该解决的问题
that's your problem.

570
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:54,740
菲尔 亲爱的
Phil? Honey?

571
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:55,640
克莱尔
Claire?

572
00:18:56,058 --> 00:18:57,498
上帝啊
Ohh. God.

573
00:18:57,680 --> 00:18:58,880
我得喝点水
I had to get some water.

574
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,920
我在追那个疯子
I was chasing that crazy maniac.

575
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:03,020
差一点就追上了
I got so close.

576
00:19:03,120 --> 00:19:04,400
然后你就这么放弃了
And you just gave up?

577
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:06,260
那可不是我所认识的克莱尔
That's not the Claire that I know.

578
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:07,840
-快出去继续追呀 -真的假的
- Get back out there! - Really?

579
00:19:08,260 --> 00:19:08,480
当然了
Yeah!

580
00:19:08,700 --> 00:19:10,140
菲尔 我把手机落在药房了
Phil, I left my phone at the drugstore.

581
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:11,340
-我一会儿就回来 -好的 待会见
- I'll be right back. - Okay, bye.

582
00:19:11,360 --> 00:19:13,020
你好 我是克莱尔·邓菲
Hey. Hi. I'm Claire Dunphy.

583
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:13,820
菲尔的妻子
I'm Phil's wife.

584
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:14,940
别拉着她说了
Let's not talk her ear off.

585
00:19:15,310 --> 00:19:16,310
她该走了
She's got to go.

586
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:17,310
我是劳拉 很高兴认识你
I'm Laura. Nice to meet you.

587
00:19:17,340 --> 00:19:18,180
这房子真漂亮
Oh, beautiful house.

588
00:19:18,560 --> 00:19:19,000
谢谢
Thanks.

589
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:20,480
你会经过格林利夫吗
Hey, are you going by Greenleaf?

590
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:21,900
会
Actually, yeah.

591
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:23,580
我刚才骑车骑得太累了
I just overdid it on my bike,

592
00:19:23,580 --> 00:19:25,160
现在没劲骑回去了
and I cannot get back on there.

593
00:19:25,380 --> 00:19:26,260
没问题 我载你一程
No problem. I'll give you a ride.

594
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:27,580
这主意太糟了
That's a terrible idea.

595
00:19:27,690 --> 00:19:29,591
-为什么 -为什么
- Why? - Why?

596
00:19:30,100 --> 00:19:31,520
我这希望我是那种
I wish I were one of those people

597
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:34,140
热爱双重身份所带来的刺激感的人
who thrives on the danger of leading a double life.

598
00:19:34,340 --> 00:19:35,060
就像是布鲁斯·韦恩
You know, Bruce Wayne,

599
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:35,860
彼得·帕克
Peter Parker,

600
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:36,940
汉娜·蒙塔那
Hannah Montana.

601
00:19:38,260 --> 00:19:40,620
那个主意 太糟了
That's a terrible...idea,

602
00:19:41,580 --> 00:19:43,220
因为你的自行车还在这呢
because your bike is here.

603
00:19:44,400 --> 00:19:46,300
你准备怎么办 就把车丢在这 那太失礼了
What are you gonna do? Leave it? That's rude!

604
00:19:46,440 --> 00:19:47,540
那随时过来拿就好了
Oh, just pick it up whenever.

605
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:49,500
随时 什么是随时
Whenever?! What's "whenever"?

606
00:19:49,540 --> 00:19:50,640
那也太随意了
That's so open-ended.

607
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:51,640
行了 别叫唤了
Oh, stop it.

608
00:19:51,660 --> 00:19:52,660
走吧 克莱尔 咱们走
Come on, Claire. Let's fly.

609
00:19:52,702 --> 00:19:54,362
我喜欢她这么活力四射
Ahh. I love her energy.

610
00:19:54,860 --> 00:19:55,720
我来啦
I'm coming!

611
00:20:00,933 --> 00:20:03,563
你为什么要搬走
So, why do you want to move?

612
00:20:03,603 --> 00:20:06,303
我想住在有门卫的大厦里
Ah, I want a high-rise with a doorman.

613
00:20:07,703 --> 00:20:09,733
再说 这个小区有点疯狂
Besides, this neighborhood is getting a little crazy.

614
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:10,920
感同身受呀
Oh, tell me about it.

615
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,200
有个疯子
There's this one whack job...

616
00:20:12,303 --> 00:20:13,574
不用再多说了
You know, don't say another word.

617
00:20:13,614 --> 00:20:15,244
我敢说我知道你要说的是谁
I bet I know exactly who you're thinking of.

618
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:29,240
克莱尔气得要死
Claire was furious.

619
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:31,080
她说我从各个角度都背叛了她
She said I betrayed her on every level.

620
00:20:31,740 --> 00:20:33,880
所以我打电话给花店
So, I called the florist,

621
00:20:34,320 --> 00:20:38,100
订了一打气球
and I have ordered one dozen mylar balloons.

622
00:20:39,800 --> 00:20:41,340
看你还能气多久 亲爱的
Good luck staying mad, honey.

623
00:20:43,385 --> 00:20:45,566
快点 是那个文明社会发明了字母表
Come on, which civilization invent the alphabet

624
00:20:45,566 --> 00:20:46,756
我不知道
I don't know.

625
00:20:46,756 --> 00:20:47,466
你知道的
Yes, you do.

626
00:20:47,466 --> 00:20:49,176
这个问题我们都复习了上百遍了
We've been over this a hundred times.

627
00:20:49,176 --> 00:20:52,216
老爸 让我来 我是个很厉害的老师
Allow me, dad. I'm a great teacher.

628
00:20:52,246 --> 00:20:54,546
谁发明了字母表
Who invented the alphabet?

629
00:20:54,586 --> 00:20:56,646
我 不 知 道
I...don't...know.

630
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:57,520
卢克
Luke!

631
00:20:58,386 --> 00:20:59,517
我浑身都湿了 你干吗呀
I got soaked! What are you doing?!

632
00:20:59,780 --> 00:21:00,700
说呀 说呀
Say it! Say it!

633
00:21:00,740 --> 00:21:01,600
卢克 别闹了
Luke, that's enough!

634
00:21:01,740 --> 00:21:02,960
我的天呐
Oh, my god!

635
00:21:03,040 --> 00:21:04,420
我不知道 我不知道 我不知道
I don't know! I don't know! I don't know!

636
00:21:04,440 --> 00:21:05,520
是腓尼基人 是腓尼基人
The Phoenicians! The Phoenicians!

637
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:07,960
答案 正确
That's...right.

638
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:09,820
本年度最杰出的老师
Teacher of the year.

639
00:21:12,540 --> 00:21:13,740
我把她交给你了 兄弟
She's all yours, buddy.
